- [/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-discover-assets/SKILL.md](/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-discover-assets/SKILL.md:9) — 비변경 Phase A와 materialization Phase B
- [/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-compose-solution/SKILL.md](/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-compose-solution/SKILL.md:9) — Graph, Root Executable, binding 및 runtime contract
- [/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-scaffold-runtime/SKILL.md](/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-scaffold-runtime/SKILL.md:9) — 승인된 composition에서 ADK source/Runtime Handoff 생성
- [/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-verify-runtime/SKILL.md](/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/af-verify-runtime/SKILL.md:9) — revision과 runtime/behavior 증거 검증

일반 ADK 개발 흐름의 보조 근거는 다음입니다.

- [/home/ilmaswsl/.agents/skills/google-agents-cli-workflow/SKILL.md](/home/ilmaswsl/.agents/skills/google-agents-cli-workflow/SKILL.md:69) — Understand, samples, scaffold, build, eval, deploy, publish, observe
- [/home/ilmaswsl/.agents/skills/google-agents-cli-scaffold/SKILL.md](/home/ilmaswsl/.agents/skills/google-agents-cli-scaffold/SKILL.md:30) — 일반 ADK 프로젝트 scaffold와 prototype-first 권고

다만 Agent Factory의 authority 규칙은 Google Agents CLI skill을 “구조와 workflow의 예시일 뿐 Agent Factory authority는 아니다”라고 명시합니다. 근거: [/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/_shared/source-of-truth.md](/home/ilmaswsl/work/af-companion-skillsync/.agents/skills/_shared/source-of-truth.md:14). 따라서 충돌 시 현재 저장소의 schema, validator, CLI, generator와 Agent Factory Work Skills가 우선합니다.

